	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h03_middlewoman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あー！　うるさいわ
とっても　うるさい！▼
なにがって？　でんしゃ！▼
でんしゃが　したを　とおるときの
おとが　とんでもなく　うるさいの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:36:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:36:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あー！　うるさいわ
とっても　うるさい！▼
なにがって？　電車！▼
電車が　下を　通過するときの
音が　とんでもなく　うるさいの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:42:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:39:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けて
　middlewoman2_02から05をランダムで抽出
・ギザウインで
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:45:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:35:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h03_middlewoman2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぐたいてきに　どれくらい
うるさいかって　いうと……▽
７０デシベル　くらいよ！▼
たくさん　ひとがいる
ヒウンシティの　おおどおり　くらいね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:36:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:36:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>具体的に　どれくらい
うるさいかって　いうと……▽
７０デシベル　くらいよ！▼
たくさん　人がいる
ヒウンシティの　大通り　くらいね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:43:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:39:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けて
　特性ぼうおんのポケモンが
　いる　→middlewoman2_07
　いない→middlewoman2_06
・ギザウインで
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:46:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
